# Shell scripts MUST keep LF endings.
#
# This is not cosmetic. These launchers run under WSL/Linux, and a CRLF line
# ending turns the shebang into `/usr/bin/env bash\r`, which fails with
#   /usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory
# That exact failure cost real time on this project — see docs/ENGINEERING_LOG.md
# gotcha 22, where the launcher installer could not even bootstrap itself.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Python is executed by the interpreter, which handles either, but keep it
# consistent so diffs stay clean across Windows and Linux checkouts.
*.py text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.pt binary
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.stl binary
*.obj binary
*.npz binary
